WEBVTT

00:14:28.919 --> 00:14:31.844
I dok smo se vraćali dole

00:14:31.844 --> 00:14:34.404
mi nismo vrištali,

00:14:34.404 --> 00:14:36.780
mi smo se smijali;

00:14:36.780 --> 00:14:37.848
bilo je zabavno.

00:14:37.848 --> 00:14:39.776
I kada se otvori padobran,

00:14:39.776 --> 00:14:41.405
iako se i ne otvori nismo brinuli,

00:14:41.485 --> 00:14:42.390
jer imamo rezervni

00:14:42.390 --> 00:14:44.391
koji radi na principu satnog mehanizma.

00:14:44.391 --> 00:14:46.773
I dok smo se vraćali brzinom munje,

00:14:46.773 --> 00:14:48.659
to je izgledalo ovako,

00:14:48.659 --> 00:14:51.259
sletjeli smo u (Soyuz) u Kazahstan.

00:14:51.259 --> 00:14:53.402
(Video) Reporter: I možete da vidite
jedan od

00:14:53.402 --> 00:14:55.998
ovih helikoptera za potragu, ponovo

00:14:55.998 --> 00:14:59.009
helikopter pripada Ruskoj vojsci i sastavu

00:14:59.009 --> 00:15:03.637
MI-8 helikoptera.